{
    "title": "LandMap: Property Line Finder",
    "description": "Landmap is your ultimate property line finder and parcel map application, designed to offer comprehensive land mapping and ownership details. Ideal for landowners, farmers, brokers, realtors, and real estate professionals, Landmap ensures you get transparent and up-to-date information on nearly every parcel of land within the U.S. With 160 million parcel records covering 99% of U.S. citizens, Landmap makes property line and ownership data readily accessible.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\r\nDETAILED PROPERTY LINE FINDER INFO\r\n>> Access land parcel ID, parcel address\r\n>> Check property boundaries, property value\r\n>> Get land owner contact, mailing address\r\n\r\nFIND SIMILAR PROPERTIES\r\n>> Set a distance from a particular location to find properties \r\n>> Filter by specific radius, number of bedrooms and bathrooms, similar living area, and more\r\n\r\nLAND MEASURE TOOL\r\n>> Draw your field maps and land property lines\r\n>> Measure the distance, perimeter, or area accurately\r\n>> Track the distance with GPS tracking\r\n\r\nOFFLINE PARCEL FINDER\r\n>> Create your own offline maps\r\n>> Access land data on the go\r\n>> 3 map views modes: Topo maps, satellite, and street view\r\n\r\nLAND PARCEL WATCHLIST\r\n>> Save land parcels for easy reference\r\n>> Share land parcel listing across the US\r\n>> Get automated land parcel updates \r\n\r\nWith over 165 million parcel records covering 99% of the US population, our app help you to find property lines, owner info, and more without the need for a geological survey. The property line finder feature ensures you can accurately determine the boundaries of any parcel, while the parcel map provides a visual representation of land ownership.\r\n\r\nThis app allows you to access critical information: parcel ID, address, property boundaries, and value. You can also obtain contact details and mailing addresses for landowners, making it easier to reach out for inquiries or negotiations. The land measure tool is perfect for those who need to draw field maps and property lines with precision. You can measure distances, perimeters, and areas accurately, and even track your movements with GPS tracking. \r\n\r\nOur offline parcel finder ensures you have access to land data even when you're on the go. Create your own offline maps and choose from three different map view modes: Topo maps, satellite, and street view. This flexibility allows you to visualize land properties in various ways, depending on your needs.\r\n\r\nThe land parcel watchlist feature lets you save parcels for easy reference, share listings across the US, and receive automated updates on any changes. This ensures you stay informed about the properties you're interested in, making it easier to manage your land portfolio.\r\n\r\n1. How to find property lines with Landmap?\r\nFinding your property lines with Landmap is easy. To get started, just insert your address or parcel ID and Landmap will find your property and show you the property lines. You can also use your current location if you're trying to find out information like the parcel number. Alternatively, you can use the map to find the parcel manually.\r\n\r\n2. How to find property owner with Landmap? \r\nIf you need to contact a owner of a property, you can do this using Landmap by tapping on the parcel in the app to find the owner's contact information, including phone number and email address. This is helpful to help you have more valuable information on acreage, value, elevation, and more. Landmap, along with other must-have apps for realtors, will elevate your business by improving data access and client interactions.\r\n\r\n3. Is it possible to draw field maps and property lines accurately with Landmap's land measure tool?\r\nAbsolutely! With our land measure tool, you can draw field maps and property lines with high accuracy. Measure distances, perimeters, and areas accurately to understand your land boundaries clearly. \r\n\r\nGet started with Landmap now! \r\nPrivacy Policy: http://astraler.com/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: http://astraler.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Landmap is your ultimate property line finder and parcel map application, designed to offer comprehensive land mapping and ownership details. Ideal for landowners, farmers, brokers, realtors, and real estate professionals, Landmap ensures you get transparent and up-to-date information on nearly every parcel of land within the U.S. With 160 million parcel records covering 99% of U.S. citizens, Landmap makes property line and ownership data readily accessible.<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br><br>DETAILED PROPERTY LINE FINDER INFO<br>&gt;&gt; Access land parcel ID, parcel address<br>&gt;&gt; Check property boundaries, property value<br>&gt;&gt; Get land owner contact, mailing address<br><br>FIND SIMILAR PROPERTIES<br>&gt;&gt; Set a distance from a particular location to find properties <br>&gt;&gt; Filter by specific radius, number of bedrooms and bathrooms, similar living area, and more<br><br>LAND MEASURE TOOL<br>&gt;&gt; Draw your field maps and land property lines<br>&gt;&gt; Measure the distance, perimeter, or area accurately<br>&gt;&gt; Track the distance with GPS tracking<br><br>OFFLINE PARCEL FINDER<br>&gt;&gt; Create your own offline maps<br>&gt;&gt; Access land data on the go<br>&gt;&gt; 3 map views modes: Topo maps, satellite, and street view<br><br>LAND PARCEL WATCHLIST<br>&gt;&gt; Save land parcels for easy reference<br>&gt;&gt; Share land parcel listing across the US<br>&gt;&gt; Get automated land parcel updates <br><br>With over 165 million parcel records covering 99% of the US population, our app help you to find property lines, owner info, and more without the need for a geological survey. The property line finder feature ensures you can accurately determine the boundaries of any parcel, while the parcel map provides a visual representation of land ownership.<br><br>This app allows you to access critical information: parcel ID, address, property boundaries, and value. You can also obtain contact details and mailing addresses for landowners, making it easier to reach out for inquiries or negotiations. The land measure tool is perfect for those who need to draw field maps and property lines with precision. You can measure distances, perimeters, and areas accurately, and even track your movements with GPS tracking. <br><br>Our offline parcel finder ensures you have access to land data even when you&#39;re on the go. Create your own offline maps and choose from three different map view modes: Topo maps, satellite, and street view. This flexibility allows you to visualize land properties in various ways, depending on your needs.<br><br>The land parcel watchlist feature lets you save parcels for easy reference, share listings across the US, and receive automated updates on any changes. This ensures you stay informed about the properties you&#39;re interested in, making it easier to manage your land portfolio.<br><br>1. How to find property lines with Landmap?<br>Finding your property lines with Landmap is easy. To get started, just insert your address or parcel ID and Landmap will find your property and show you the property lines. You can also use your current location if you&#39;re trying to find out information like the parcel number. Alternatively, you can use the map to find the parcel manually.<br><br>2. How to find property owner with Landmap? <br>If you need to contact a owner of a property, you can do this using Landmap by tapping on the parcel in the app to find the owner&#39;s contact information, including phone number and email address. This is helpful to help you have more valuable information on acreage, value, elevation, and more. Landmap, along with other must-have apps for realtors, will elevate your business by improving data access and client interactions.<br><br>3. Is it possible to draw field maps and property lines accurately with Landmap&#39;s land measure tool?<br>Absolutely! With our land measure tool, you can draw field maps and property lines with high accuracy. Measure distances, perimeters, and areas accurately to understand your land boundaries clearly. <br><br>Get started with Landmap now! <br>Privacy Policy: http://astraler.com/privacy-policy<br>Terms of Use: http://astraler.com/terms",
